  triage:title "New AX.3 SQLite boundary record omits the daemon->rusqlite forbidden edge its siblings declare" ;
  triage:description "task-store-sqlite.toml:25 forbidden_edges lists atm-storage-rusqlite -> atm-core and -> atm-runtime but not \"atm-daemon -> atm-storage-rusqlite\", while async-task-ledger-reader-sqlite.toml:25, mail-store-sqlite.toml:34-40 and roster-store-sqlite.toml:34-40 all declare it, matching runtime-composition.toml:26-31. The aggregate test guarded_boundaries_forbid_every_declared_crate_edge still passes because it checks the union, so this is per-record drift (AA.5 invariant), not a live enforcement gap. Remediation: add the edge to task-store-sqlite.toml forbidden_edges. Frozen-file ruling (fenix, 2026-09-06): this one-line addition to boundaries/atm-storage-rusqlite/task-store-sqlite.toml is approved; no other boundary TOML change is." ;
